Source: https://github.com/jmcruzGH/amaya-modern
Comment: Port of Amaya 11.4.7 (W3C/Inria, https://github.com/w3c/Amaya-Editor)
 to current Linux systems.  The changes made by the port are listed in
 README.md ("What changed from Amaya 11.4.7") and, in detail, in the git
 history.

